 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bjfdr10MjbUQ7kNvwGod_yJ&_nc_oc=AdogQjZWs4YPp4JOKT80_SxnPdY2zclI4inKhERZO3UYkAJXOy2BHNEYUK0F7jD5OD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMoFYSZ2ZEP94q_UwpizGbql2fVunCaiCPses7h36_Aqw&oe=6AC51141"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t2OKWVvxMEUQ7kNvwGD8x4E&_nc_oc=AdqXV_9bw14V1Pm_jXfaZNXUQZUNkffBSitaE5QcYAs9D74-vbr6lK8ioaZMVnomR8k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMTvWtVHd0JCqRUYgPPeSK2dwUlKCHxaDkKnBaM7herXA&oe=6AC51EA6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RwwQ9TQargEQ7kNvwG7rQXR&_nc_oc=AdpGvMcFFUHznwIzZE1w5Llrkmw92P8vU1hk8QEi8D9xY8U3EojSbxjQdgtVcdZTdDE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP4RpiSlDcT4BUaZ8zlVleLYCy1XjSe-YSQu_gHkbFqmw&oe=6AC5289C"}, {"fil